0.08] bg-[radial-gradient(40rem_20rem_at_0%_0%,rgba(26,89,204,0.18),transparent_70%)] p-5 sm:p-7\"><figcaption class=\"mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ssl-gold\">How a post gets from the site to social media</figcaption><ol class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-stretch\"><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Intake form</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Project photos, videos and notes</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><span class=\"md:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 36\" class=\"mx-auto my-1 h-9 w-4 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M3 26l5 6 5-6\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden md:flex\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 self-center\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M30 3l6 5-6 5\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">n8n</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Self-hosted on Oracle Cloud free tier</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><span class=\"md:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 36\" class=\"mx-auto my-1 h-9 w-4 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M3 26l5 6 5-6\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden md:flex\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 self-center\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M30 3l6 5-6 5\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Caption generation</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Tip, project, call to action</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><span class=\"md:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 36\" class=\"mx-auto my-1 h-9 w-4 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M3 26l5 6 5-6\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden md:flex\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 self-center\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M30 3l6 5-6 5\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Publish daily at 10:00</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#ead7ad]\">Facebook</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#ead7ad]\">Instagram</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#ead7ad]\">Reels</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#ead7ad]\">LinkedIn (next)</li></ul></div></li></ol><p class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(197,160,89,0.8)]\"></span>Missed run: alert email sent at once</p></figure></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">A growing construction firm with no marketing department needed to post every day across its social channels. It had a tight one-time budget and almost no staff time to give.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Founder, Signal Strait Labs. I scoped, designed and built the whole system.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Run it on free tools so the client can keep it at zero monthly cost. Self-host the automation engine instead of paying for a platform.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>An automation pipeline on self-hosted n8n, running on the Oracle Cloud free tier.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>One intake form for all content. The team adds a project once and the system does the rest.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Captions that change every day: each opens with a useful tip, then shows the project and ends with a call to action.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Daily posts at 10:00 on Facebook and Instagram, including carousels, with videos going out as Instagram Reels.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Instant alert emails if a scheduled run is missed.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>LinkedIn company page posting, now being added. I&#x27;m also improving the client&#x27;s WordPress website.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"The n8n workflow that runs the daily posts\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/railsite-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">The automation workflow</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 md:w-64 md:flex-col\"><figure class=\"w-full max-w-[16rem]\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[17rem] rounded-[2.2rem] border border-white/15 bg-[#0a1634] p-2.5 shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.7rem] bg-[#06112e]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-2 z-10 h-4 w-20 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-black/70\"></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1080 / 1350\"><img alt=\"A sample post published by the system\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/railsite-2.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">A published post</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-lead-framework\" aria-labelledby=\"case-lead-framework-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">Indepth Research Institute (IRES)</p><h3 id=\"case-lead-framework-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Lead management framework for a training institute</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Strategy and Leadership</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><figure class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[radial-gradient(40rem_20rem_at_100%_0%,rgba(26,89,204,0.18),transparent_70%)] p-5 sm:p-7\"><figcaption class=\"mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ssl-gold\">Who owns a lead at each stage</figcaption><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-stretch\"><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] p-4\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Marketing</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Digital marketers</p><ol class=\"mt-4 space-y-2\"><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-ssl-blue/35 bg-[#081a45]/70 px-3 py-2\" style=\"margin-inline:0%\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">New lead</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300\">First contact</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-ssl-blue/35 bg-[#081a45]/70 px-3 py-2\" style=\"margin-inline:4%\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Marketing qualified</p></li></ol></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-ssl-gold/50 bg-ssl-gold/[0.06] p-4 text-center md:w-48\"><span class=\"md:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 36\" class=\"mx-auto my-1 h-9 w-4 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M3 26l5 6 5-6\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden md:flex\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 self-center\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M30 3l6 5-6 5\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-gold\">The handoff</p><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Where leads used to go cold. Now it has an owner and a response time target.</p></div><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] p-4\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Sales</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Sales reps, then customer success</p><ol class=\"mt-4 space-y-2\"><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-ssl-blue/35 bg-[#081a45]/70 px-3 py-2\" style=\"margin-inline:0%\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Sales accepted</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-ssl-blue/35 bg-[#081a45]/70 px-3 py-2\" style=\"margin-inline:4%\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Sales qualified</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300\">BANT and MEDDIC</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-ssl-blue/35 bg-[#081a45]/70 px-3 py-2\" style=\"margin-inline:8%\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Opportunity</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-ssl-blue/35 bg-[#081a45]/70 px-3 py-2\" style=\"margin-inline:12%\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Deal</p></li></ol></div></div><ul class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300 sm:flex-row sm:gap-6\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold\"></span>7-step follow-up before any lead is recycled</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold\"></span>Every lost deal gets a review</li></ul></figure></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Leads moved between marketing and sales without clear definitions, owners or deadlines. Good leads went cold while each side waited on the other.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I led the design of the framework with management and the sales units.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Define every lead stage clearly, with no overlap, and tie each stage to an owner, an action and a response time.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Lead stages in HubSpot from first contact through marketing qualified, sales accepted and sales qualified, to opportunity and deal.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Clear handoffs between digital marketers, sales reps and customer success.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A 7-step multi-channel follow-up sequence before any lead is recycled.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Response time targets by role.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Qualification using BANT and MEDDIC.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A rule that every lost deal gets a review.</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The result</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><p class=\"\">The target I set: 40% of marketing qualified leads become sales qualified.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"HubSpot pipeline view with details blurred\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/lead-framework-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">The pipeline in HubSpot</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-course-finder\" aria-labelledby=\"case-course-finder-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">IRES, healthcare and humanitarian units</p><h3 id=\"case-course-finder-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Course Finder and Training Needs Assessment tools</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Engineering</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Systems and Automation</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Visitors didn&#x27;t know which course fit them, and the site had no smart way to capture high-intent leads.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I designed and built both tools.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Give visitors something worth having in exchange for their details: a short set of questions and a report they can keep.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Interactive web tools that ask a short set of questions. Later questions change based on earlier answers.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Course recommendations drawn from the catalogue, with free-text answers matched to course topics.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Lead capture built into the flow.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A branded PDF report the visitor can download at the end.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"The Course Finder on a laptop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/course-finder-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">Course Finder</figcaption></figure><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"The Training Needs Assessment tool\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/needs-assessment-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">Training Needs Assessment</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 md:w-64 md:flex-col\"><figure class=\"w-full max-w-[16rem]\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[17rem] rounded-[2.2rem] border border-white/15 bg-[#0a1634] p-2.5 shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.7rem] bg-[#06112e]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-2 z-10 h-4 w-20 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-black/70\"></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1080 / 1920\"><img alt=\"The Course Finder on a phone\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/course-finder-2.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">On a phone</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-dashboard\" aria-labelledby=\"case-dashboard-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">Indepth Research Institute (IRES)</p><h3 id=\"case-dashboard-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Management marketing dashboard and monthly reporting</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Strategy and Leadership</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Management needed one honest view of marketing performance across many platforms, without paying for tools.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I designed and built the dashboard and prepare the monthly report.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">No vanity metrics. Track the path to course registrations, and nothing that doesn&#x27;t help a decision.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A free, highly visual dashboard pulling Google, Meta, LinkedIn, Google Business Profile, YouTube and TikTok data.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Weekly delivery to the CEO, Marketing Director and Business Manager.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A compact monthly report, presented alongside the sales unit and RevOps reports.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"The management marketing dashboard with numbers blurred\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/dashboard-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">The dashboard</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-paid-ads\" aria-labelledby=\"case-paid-ads-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">IRES, Apollina Healthcare, Oplos Marketing &amp; Media</p><h3 id=\"case-paid-ads-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Paid advertising and attribution system</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Strategy and Leadership</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Campaigns</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Long sales cycles and a deep website made it hard to know which ads produced paying clients. Three brands had to run under one ad account.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I designed the model and set up the tracking.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Capture attribution inside HubSpot, where sales already works, and give each brand its own naming rules so one account stays readable.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A reusable paid ads model with formula-driven budget allocation.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A UTM naming framework, with separate naming rules per brand.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Attribution captured in HubSpot through UTM properties and workflows.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A funding plan for Google Ads and Meta campaigns for courses that need to reach minimum class size.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"The paid ads budget model\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/paid-ads-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">The paid ads model</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-logistics\" aria-labelledby=\"case-logistics-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">Two Nairobi logistics firms</p><h3 id=\"case-logistics-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Lead generation for logistics companies</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Campaigns</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Systems and Automation</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><figure class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[radial-gradient(40rem_20rem_at_0%_0%,rgba(26,89,204,0.18),transparent_70%)] p-5 sm:p-7\"><figcaption class=\"mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ssl-gold\">Where each lead goes</figcaption><ol class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-stretch\"><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Meta lead ad</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Countries served by the port of Mombasa</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><span class=\"md:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 36\" class=\"mx-auto my-1 h-9 w-4 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M3 26l5 6 5-6\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden md:flex\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 self-center\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M30 3l6 5-6 5\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Lead form</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Customs or freight enquiry</p></div></li><li class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-1 md:flex-row\"><span class=\"md:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 36\" class=\"mx-auto my-1 h-9 w-4 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M3 26l5 6 5-6\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"hidden md:flex\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 self-center\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#1a59cc\" stroke-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><line class=\"eric-flow\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M30 3l6 5-6 5\" stroke=\"#C5A059\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-ssl-blue/40 bg-[#081a45]/70 p-4 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]\"><p class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Straight into</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#ead7ad]\">Brevo email nurture</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-[#ead7ad]\">Google Sheet for the team</li></ul></div></li></ol></figure></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Two logistics firms needed more customs brokerage and freight forwarding enquiries, and a way to follow up each one quickly.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Through Signal Strait Labs, I set up the campaigns and the lead flow.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Send every lead into tools the client&#x27;s team already knows, so follow-up starts the same day without new software to learn.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Meta lead campaigns for customs brokerage and freight forwarding, targeting every country served by the port of Mombasa.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Each lead flows straight into an email nurture sequence in Brevo.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>The same lead lands in a Google Sheet the client&#x27;s team already uses.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"Leads arriving in Brevo and the Google Sheet\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/logistics-ads-2.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">Lead flow</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 md:w-64 md:flex-col\"><figure class=\"w-full max-w-[16rem]\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[17rem] rounded-[2.2rem] border border-white/15 bg-[#0a1634] p-2.5 shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.7rem] bg-[#06112e]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-2 z-10 h-4 w-20 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-black/70\"></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1080 / 1350\"><img alt=\"A logistics lead ad creative\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/logistics-ads-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">Lead ad creative</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-content-plan\" aria-labelledby=\"case-content-plan-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">Indepth Research Institute (IRES)</p><h3 id=\"case-content-plan-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Rebuilding the marketing team&#x27;s content plan</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Strategy and Leadership</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">The problem</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Content was mostly course promotion, which gave people little reason to trust or follow the brand.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I reworked the plan for the team of digital marketers.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Test the new model myself first, in the humanitarian sector, before rolling it out to every unit.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A plan that covers proof, people and expertise: certifications, venues, trainers, alumni, testimonials and industry insight.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>International venues promoted daily.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>Search optimisation for AI answer engines (AEO and GEO).</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A shared content bank, as the first step toward automated posting.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"The content plan and shared content bank\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/content-plan-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">The content bank</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-search\" aria-labelledby=\"case-search-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">IRES, Apollina Healthcare, Oplos Marketing &amp; Media</p><h3 id=\"case-search-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Search visibility and authority building</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Strategy and Leadership</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Campaigns</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I set the search priorities and built the tracker.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Start with free sources, rank them by value, and track progress in one live place.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A prioritised tracker of 126 free directories, backlink and guest posting sources for Apollina and Oplos, with live progress tracking.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 h-4 flex-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.06]\"></span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#06112e]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1600 / 1000\"><img alt=\"Search rankings and traffic over time\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/eric/work/seo-1.jpg?v=1\"/></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400\">Rankings and traffic</figcaption></figure></div></div></article></dialog><dialog id=\"case-ssl-site\" aria-labelledby=\"case-ssl-site-title\" class=\"eric-dialog overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex justify-end bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030b22] via-[#030b22]/90 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-4 sm:px-6\"><button type=\"button\" autofocus=\"\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-ssl-bg/80 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-ssl-gold hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0L10 8.6l4.3-4.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4L11.4 10l4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 1.4L10 11.4l-4.3 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4-1.4L8.6 10 4.3 5.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4Z\"></path></svg>Close case study</button></div><article class=\"px-5 pb-10 pt-2 sm:px-8 md:px-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">Signal Strait Labs</p><h3 id=\"case-ssl-site-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">The Signal Strait Labs website</h3><div class=\"mt-4\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300\">Engineering</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">My role</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">I designed and built it.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I decided</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\">Build on the same stack I recommend to clients, and keep it fast on a phone.</div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\">What I built</h4><div class=\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\"><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>The firm&#x27;s site on Next.js, TypeScript and Tailwind, running on Cloudflare Workers.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>A services grid with detailed interactions.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"></span><span>An interactive project tracker used to manage builds.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid items-start gap-6 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><figure><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a1634] shadow-[0_24px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,