-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Account lists for Apollina across African markets.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade eric-card rounded-xl p-6\"><p class=\"font-display font-semibold text-white\">AI prospecting agent</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">I defined the ideal customer profile for the outside firm building it.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade eric-card rounded-xl p-6\"><p class=\"font-display font-semibold text-white\">Executive apparel</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Branded apparel for the IRES management team.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"leadership\" aria-labelledby=\"eric-leadership-heading\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-24 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28 border-y border-white/[0.06] bg-[radial-gradient(60rem_30rem_at_0%_0%,rgba(26,89,204,0.14),transparent_70%)]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] md:gap-16\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-ssl-gold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-ssl-gold/60\"></span>For hiring teams</p><h2 id=\"eric-leadership-heading\" class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-[2.75rem] md:leading-[1.1]\">Leadership and management</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg\">What I own day to day, beyond the builds.</p></div><a href=\"/eric/eric-nyaga-cv.pdf?v=1\" download=\"Eric-Nyaga-CV.pdf\" class=\"mt-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-ssl-gold px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-bg transition-colors hover:bg-[#d4b273] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-gold focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-ssl-bg\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M10 3v10m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M4 16h12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Download CV</a></div><ul class=\"divide-y divide-white/[0.07] border-y border-white/[0.07]\"><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-4 py-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-ssl-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:text-lg\">I report to and work with the CEO and management team on marketing direction, budgets and results.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-4 py-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-ssl-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:text-lg\">I lead and coordinate the marketing team across sector units.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-4 py-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-ssl-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:text-lg\">I&#x27;m involved in sales execution: lead handoffs, follow-up standards and deal reviews.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-4 py-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-ssl-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:text-lg\">I manage outside vendors and partners, for example defining requirements for an AI prospecting agent built by an external firm.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-4 py-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-ssl-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:text-lg\">I run marketing for several brands at once, each with its own audience and budget.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"capabilities\" aria-labelledby=\"eric-capabilities-heading\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-24 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2