 spend money. That way we can tell which channel brought a paying client, not just which one got clicks.\"}]]}]],\"ref\":null}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Speed and follow-up beat volume.\",{\"className\":\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-5 bg-ssl-bg p-7 sm:p-9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"font-display text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-ssl-gold\",\"children\":\"03\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-white\",\"children\":\"Speed and follow-up beat volume.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-300\",\"children\":\"A warm lead left for two weeks is a lost lead. I design follow-up so response speed matches how ready the buyer is.\"}]]}]],\"ref\":null}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Build for the team you have.\",{\"className\":\"reveal reveal-fade flex gap-5 bg-ssl-bg p-7 sm:p-9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"font-display text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-ssl-gold\",\"children\":\"04\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-white\",\"children\":\"Build for the team you have.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-300\",\"children\":\"The best tool is the one your team will actually use. I automate the repetitive work so people can focus on the conversations that close.\"}]]}]],\"ref\":null}]]}]]}]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"roles\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"eric-roles-heading\",\"className\":\"relative scroll-mt-24 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(26,89,204,0.06),transparent)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-s