 and sales without clear definitions, owners or deadlines. Good leads went cold while each side waited on the other.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\",\"children\":\"My role\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\",\"children\":\"I led the design of the framework with management and the sales units.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\",\"children\":\"What I decided\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\",\"children\":\"Define every lead stage clearly, with no overlap, and tie each stage to an owner, an action and a response time.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] py-6 md:grid-cols-[11rem_1fr] md:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ssl-gold\",\"children\":\"What I built\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed text-slate-200\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-2.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Lead stages in HubSpot from first contact through marketing qualified, sales accepted and sales qualified, to opportunity and deal.\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-2.5 h-1 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ssl-gold/70\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Lead stages in HubSpot from first contact through marketing qualified, sales accepted and sales qualified, to opportunity and deal.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Clear handoffs between digital marketers, sales reps and cust